msgctxt "92"
msgid "Did I hear you say something about English classes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Oh, yes! Haven't you ever considered taking lessons before?\r\n"
"If you register now, you're entitled to a free handbook\r\n"
"that'll teach you all the ins and outs of the language."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Hmm... I'm not so sure..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Oh, but fluency in English will greatly expand your horizons.\r\n"
"Don't you want to be able to communicate with foreigners?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Here, why don't you try reading this book first? Then you'll\r\n"
"be speaking natural English in no time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Free English Textbook<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Start with the useful expressions on the first page. For\r\n"
"example, if you see someone in trouble, all you need to do is\r\n"
"ask, Ｄｏ　ｙｏｕ　ｎｅｅｄ　ｓｏｍｅ　ｈｅｌｐ？"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"English is the kind of language where you can say one thing\r\n"
"a lot of different ways, so it can be a little intimidating\r\n"
"at first..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Our English handbooks teach you exactly what you need to\r\n"
"know without the extra fluff! Not only that, but each phrase\r\n"
"has been academically peer-reviewed for optimal accuracy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Now I hope you enjoy the course, and as we say in English...\r\n"
"Ｈａｖｅ　ａ　ｎｉｃｅ　ｄａｙ！"
msgstr ""

